{"id":"08022e9739f16906","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann.md","title":"thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann (Sipser-Gács-Lautemann Theorem)","display":"thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann (Sipser-Gács-Lautemann Theorem)","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann (Sipser-Gács-Lautemann Theorem)","label":"28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann","type":"theorem","aliases":["28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann","Sipser-Gács-Lautemann Theorem","BPP is in the second level of PH"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]","[[28-thm-bpp-amplification]]","[[28-df-sigma-k-p]]","[[28-df-pi-k-p]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 7.15 and proof; printed pp.136–137; PDF pp.162–163","source_printed_pages":"136–137","source_pdf_pages":"162–163","source_status":"statement-checked","proof_status":"local-proof-reviewed","local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note; R7"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann (Sipser-Gács-Lautemann Theorem)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-sipser-gacs-lautemann</span><span>Sipser-Gács-Lautemann Theorem</span><span>BPP is in the second level of PH</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1165db05a0a23506\" href=\"?note=1165db05a0a23506\" title=\"28-thm-bpp-amplification\">28-thm-bpp-amplification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 7.15 and proof; printed pp.136–137; PDF pp.162–163"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"136–137"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"162–163"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local-proof-reviewed"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; R7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{BPP}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是经 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1165db05a0a23506\" href=\"?note=1165db05a0a23506\" title=\"28-thm-bpp-amplification\">28-thm-bpp-amplification</a> 放大的确定型随机带机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=|x|\">\\(n=|x|\\)</span>，使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m(n)\">\\(m(n)\\)</span> 个随机位。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon:\\mathbb N\\to(0,1)\">\\(\\epsilon:\\mathbb N\\to(0,1)\\)</span>；对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_r[M(y;r)\\ne\\chi_L(y)]\\le\\epsilon(|y|)\">\\(\\Pr_r[M(y;r)\\ne\\chi_L(y)]\\le\\epsilon(|y|)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,1\\}^{m(|y|)}\">\\(\\{0,1\\}^{m(|y|)}\\)</span> 上均匀。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(m,t:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span> 在一元输入上多项式时间可计算且多项式有界；对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(u\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{m(u)}\\epsilon(u)^{t(u)}&lt;1\">\\(2^{m(u)}\\epsilon(u)^{t(u)}&lt;1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(u)\\epsilon(u)&lt;1\">\\(t(u)\\epsilon(u)&lt;1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L\">\\(\\chi_L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_y\">\\(A_y\\)</span> 由下式定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\oplus z\">\\(r\\oplus z\\)</span> 为逐位模二相加。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P},\\Pi_2^{\\mathbf P}\">\\(\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P},\\Pi_2^{\\mathbf P}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e4f9f10bc85fd486\" href=\"?note=e4f9f10bc85fd486\" title=\"28-df-sigma-k-p\">28-df-sigma-k-p</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2bc4265180c3d2ff\" href=\"?note=2bc4265180c3d2ff\" title=\"28-df-pi-k-p\">28-df-pi-k-p</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L(y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;y\\in L,\\\\0&amp;y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L,\\end{cases}\\qquad A_y\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(|y|)}:M(y;r)=1\\}\\quad(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\chi_L(y)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1&amp;y\\in L,\\\\0&amp;y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\setminus L,\\end{cases}\\qquad A_y\\coloneqq\\{r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(|y|)}:M(y;r)=1\\}\\quad(y\\in\\{0,1\\}^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{BPP}\\subseteq\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}\\cap\\Pi_2^{\\mathbf P}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{BPP}\\subseteq\\Sigma_2^{\\mathbf P}\\cap\\Pi_2^{\\mathbf P}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"x\\in L\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists z_1,\\ldots,z_{t(n)}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\bigvee_{i=1}^{t(n)}\\bigl(r\\oplus z_i\\in A_x\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[x\\in L\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists z_1,\\ldots,z_{t(n)}\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\forall r\\in\\{0,1\\}^{m(n)}\\;\\bigvee_{i=1}^{t(n)}\\bigl(r\\oplus z_i\\in A_x\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应定理 7.15 的平移覆盖证明。是实例的独立随机平移漏掉固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的概率至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon(n)^{t(n)}\">\\(\\epsilon(n)^{t(n)}\\)</span>，对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 并合后仍小于 1；否实例任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(n)\">\\(t(n)\\)</span> 个平移的并集大小至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(n)\\epsilon(n)2^{m(n)}&lt;2^{m(n)}\">\\(t(n)\\epsilon(n)2^{m(n)}&lt;2^{m(n)}\\)</span>。有限析取由多项式时间矩阵直接计算，没有引入第三个量词块。对补语言重复得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_2\">\\(\\Pi_2\\)</span> 包含；有限小长度可硬编码。</p>\n<p>R6本地证明复核：对充分大n，将错误放大到2^{-n}，令t(n)=m(n)+1；m为多项式，故两项严格不等式均最终成立。有限短输入可硬编码答案并取m=1、t=2和错误上界1/4，使条件在所有长度成立。已复核本节所列完整概率/模拟推导；此状态针对本地论证，不把旧来源定位自动升级为逐页证明核验。</p>\n<p>R6历史依赖证据：覆盖/平移局部概率推导当时已复核，无条件BPP包含当时仍使用放大与Chernoff受限证明，故当时没有已核验依赖资格。</p>\n<p>R7依赖证据复核：本轮已独立核对上游有限独立比特的完整矩母函数证明、上下尾指数常数与奇数多数放大；本条所需的错误界可由这些本地证明取得。对充分大n取错误不超过2<sup>{-n}、t=m+1，得到2</sup>m(2<sup>{-n})</sup>{m+1}&lt;1及(m+1)2^{-n}&lt;1；有限短长度按上段硬编码。所有平移向量合计t(n)m(n)位，穷举内层析取可在多项式时间计算，所以这是Sigma2公式。翻转原BPP算法的输出并重复同一论证给补语言的Sigma2公式，从而得到Pi2包含。此前证明限制已由本轮完整本地推导解除；source_proof_reviewed=false仍单独表示未把原书每步证明升级为本轮完整核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Asser